{
 "batchId": "b-0380",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_6f60b5ebc5b5f7f75ea0",
   "sourceHash": "6f60b5ebc5b5f7f75ea0f760dda99de2911717ab3b404876fbb30548cbd5782f",
   "text": "分享您的反馈",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0672efd974bb7c59a2ef",
   "sourceHash": "0672efd974bb7c59a2efec6484264ee9fc652f9bcfef7b362e7ff2cb106e6068",
   "text": "批评与赞赏是人类认知中两个不同却又密切相关的方面。二者都会影响我们未来的行为，并帮助我们做出更好的决定。正如任何行业中的经验对于个人或机构发展和提升自身素质至关重要一样，赞扬或批评同样必不可少，它们能够揭示优势与不足，并为如何应对具体情况提供指引。提供恰当的反馈是我们的责任，因为作为服务的使用者，我们最有条件客观地描述一项服务。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4f5e5695184d766f0a7c",
   "sourceHash": "4f5e5695184d766f0a7c2834f33088c03ff768d159df12ce97b823db8d291bf5",
   "text": "一个机构对服务的投入与承诺，与其所获得的反馈同样重要。如果没有适当的反馈或评价，机构很难独自发现系统性的问题。反馈机制的意义正在于此。服务使用者可以通过这一机制表达他们的所有意见，而机构也能从他们的经历中获得启发。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8b9289b1e83f26547b2b",
   "sourceHash": "8b9289b1e83f26547b2be5adad59dfbeb470cb776c26fa40201e22f09458ac0c",
   "text": "为此，Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 设有一个专门的栏目，名为“",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6f4f8601d9a140b63e25",
   "sourceHash": "6f4f8601d9a140b63e25b6d4b53c9a46c107cd25624f446d82b6bb21b0a9663d",
   "text": "访客意见与反馈",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Guest' rendered as 访客 (visitor) per clinical register rule."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4a20053c3aac80f63c08",
   "sourceHash": "4a20053c3aac80f63c08486eba9745691d8a4477477f317140f989733a9e650f",
   "text": "”。访客可以通过填写一份专门的问卷，对其到访经历及所接受的服务类型进行全面评价。Kairali 希望借助这一反馈机制，进一步提升其本已出色的工作作风，确保访客在此期间不遇到任何问题。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'guests' rendered as 访客 (visitors) per clinical register rule."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ded8ad592de54253578f",
   "sourceHash": "ded8ad592de54253578fb60cada2b36c6c0f31e7e02bdb4f771e56a32d3f17b5",
   "text": "为此，Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 设有一个专门的栏目，名为“访客意见与反馈”。访客可以通过填写一份专门的问卷，对其到访经历及所接受的服务类型进行全面评价。Kairali 希望借助这一反馈机制，进一步提升其本已出色的工作作风，确保访客在此期间不遇到任何问题。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Guest/guests' rendered as 访客 (visitor) per clinical register rule."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_96a11330b1d53865a05e",
   "sourceHash": "96a11330b1d53865a05efe4976f95ef5df668625ab4a6d57dfafa5aa3ffb777b",
   "text": "访客在阿育吠陀疗愈村住院期间给予我们的赞扬与肯定。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2f4185470db7e1b9a2f0",
   "sourceHash": "2f4185470db7e1b9a2f05a2ba9180e66c5f7c1d071af08ccfe6343630e1bd104",
   "text": "访客体验与 Trip Advisor 评分",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_338c536466d87fcab47f",
   "sourceHash": "338c536466d87fcab47fd532fc03f895953e5f20d470b2d226d96de5410b0927",
