   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5c39f86e5906fb30895c",
   "sourceHash": "5c39f86e5906fb30895c5f856cceec46e263e3c471d65d8faff77e7156b0c7cf",
   "text": "撰写评价",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_25e3ccd0a8a9b86bf3a8",
   "sourceHash": "25e3ccd0a8a9b86bf3a83d4300604e66004ac1745a99cb33781c398df757c5c3",
   "text": "Kairali - The Ayurvedic Healing Village 的 TripAdvisor 评分卡，显示其基于 267 条评价的旅行者评分，以及在 Palakkad 21 家酒店中排名第 1",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7e52a3a8c3d01fa0c625",
   "sourceHash": "7e52a3a8c3d01fa0c6255fa429baffbd556e9a08c878b743585e2e221b08758a",
   "text": "访客评价与感言 | Kairali 阿育吠陀疗愈村",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Guest' rendered as 访客 (visitor) per clinical register rule."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d4c874d0d738ac29d398",
   "sourceHash": "d4c874d0d738ac29d3983689626b062bb9dc42692fa3650a2ff26db7d43278c0",
   "text": "阅读访客对 Kairali 阿育吠陀、瑜伽与整体疗愈的评价，了解他们在我们位于喀拉拉邦的宁静疗愈村中的亲身体验。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'guest' rendered as 访客 (visitor); 'retreat' rendered as 疗愈村 and 'transformative wellness experiences' softened to 亲身体验 to avoid resort framing and efficacy claims."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_97780c27e153f2f310d2",
   "sourceHash": "97780c27e153f2f310d2115667b5b7a83076e76b22716aedb9763079a57bad58",
   "text": "阅读反馈",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_99c3f7d5f0ded1c5de43",
   "sourceHash": "99c3f7d5f0ded1c5de43157884acb7e9ca3fa1cc6da8e9407001346ab9c5c2d8",
   "text": "了解访客在 Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 的体验与感言。阅读已踏上阿育吠陀调养之路的访客的第一手反馈，他们体验了正宗的阿育吠陀疗法、整体疗愈与身心焕活。了解我们位于喀拉拉邦的疗愈村如何在宁静自然的环境中，通过阿育吠陀、瑜伽和个性化的健康项目为人们的生活带来改变。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'guest' rendered as 访客 (visitor); 'journey' rendered as 之路 (path) per clinical register rule."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3734a2c586639c1459af",
   "sourceHash": "3734a2c586639c1459af918e6053006e568c78e4c66281597d093354d75be814",
   "text": "适合每个人的瑜伽静修项目",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7a78aacee32e0b64bafd",
   "sourceHash": "7a78aacee32e0b64bafd961ce963044ff3b8b8d9bf6144a499e6cbc124ba588a",
   "text": "本部分介绍在瑜伽静修项目中居住的益处与意义。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d67bb01c0dc7931de780",
   "sourceHash": "d67bb01c0dc7931de7803aef8e11475fb7616b6a11ddcc7bdd1ad9ff7db511cb",
   "text": "焕活与强身治疗项目",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f7565794f385837f4770",
   "sourceHash": "f7565794f385837f47707d80f6fe6503375f66dab0f61bb2a5ae727e4b078a17",
   "text": "抵达时提供迎宾饮品。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d88dcbe6d8a899470e6d",
   "sourceHash": "d88dcbe6d8a899470e6d6023c9903e46c76abd5049cbe83e08a5a624c3a92e06",
